$ CONM2 with offset (-3, 0, -2) and no inertia: the 6x6 mass at grid 1 must be m*T*T, T = [I, -skew(x)], positive
$ semi-definite. Before the fix the R1-R3 term had the wrong sign (MGG eigenvalue -29.2; NASA/TU Delft pCRM9 wing).
$ Check: OUTPUT4 MGG (unit 21) against the exact matrix, see conm2_mass_check.py.
SOL 103
OUTPUT4 MGG,,,,//-1/21
CEND
METHOD = 1
BEGIN BULK
GRID,1,,0.,0.,0.
GRID,2,,10.,0.,0.,,123456
CBAR,1,1,1,2,0.,0.,1.
PBAR,1,1,1.,1.,1.,1.
MAT1,1,1.E6,,0.3
CONM2,4501,1,,10.,-3.,0.,-2.
EIGRL,1,,,3
ENDDATA
